              <div class="col-md-4">
                <h3>Robert Miklya</h3>
                <p>"The faculty and staff are very personable and supportive with not only academics but also care about your well-being outside of getting an education to help students be successful in all aspects of life."</p>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <h3>Dame Gamada</h3>
                <p>"English is my second language, and TRIO was a great support to me. I used their services to improve my language skills."</p>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <h3>Alexis Nordling</h3>
                <p>"DCTC offers opportunities and academic challenges to everyone, even non-traditional students like me. I never thought I could go back to school, but since attending DCTC, I've seen the faculty and staff's amazing commitment to expanding access to continued learning."</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
